            "target_entity_type": "SourceComponent",
            "paragraph": "The atmospheric simulations were conducted using version 4.3.3 of the WRF model, which was configured with the Advanced Research WRF (ARW) dynamic core. This core integrates the full set of Navier-Stokes equations, thus avoiding the hydrostatic assumption and allowing for a detailed representation of atmospheric flows. Vertical discretization employs a terrain-following hybrid sigma-pressure coordinate.",
