            "ontology_conformed": true,
            "evidence_validated": true,
            "valid": true,
            "eval": true
        },
        {
            "source_entity_instance": "SAR/CMOD5",
            "source_entity_type": "Source",
            "relation": "HAS_METRIC",
            "target_entity_instance": "MAE of 1.57 m/s",
            "target_entity_type": "Metric",
            "paragraph": "The good agreement between the SAR-derived wind speeds and the buoy observations across the entire time series of 104 SAR acquisitions spaced at 6-day intervals is shown in Figure 10. An MAE of 1.57 m/s and a RMSE of 2.03 m/s support these results, with a higher RMSE reflecting the influence of larger individual deviations between the SAR and buoy measurements.",
